[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9900","text":"到场观众的呼声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0010","text":"快看快看！\n果穗酱的字好可爱～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9901","text":"到场观众的呼声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0020","text":"说是爱依大人亲手做的玩偶！\n太意外了，反差萌啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9902","text":"到场观众的呼声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0030","text":"你看到了吗？那面神秘墙上的照片\n果然很摇滚啊，浅仓透"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9903","text":"到场观众的呼声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0040","text":"哦哦……\n这幅画，是育春画的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0050","text":"好～的，这边……！\n是企划展用的留言板哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0060","text":"雏菜，在这里～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0070","text":"这也太大了吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0079","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0073","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0080","text":"……斑鸠小姐\n有人问您是否愿意展出展品"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0090","text":"……不展"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0100","text":"只有斑鸠小姐没有展出东西了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0110","text":"签名之类的怎么样？\n对方说什么都行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0112","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0114","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0113","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0120","text":"墨水有点洇开了\n……能再给我一张吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0122","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0130","text":"…………不写了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0140","text":"非常感谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9904","text":"企划策划人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0150","text":"这就是２８３的各位想做的事情啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0160","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0162","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0170","text":"抱歉，尽说些漂亮话…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9905","text":"企划策划人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0180","text":"啊哈哈，毕竟这是２８３的企划展嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_9906","text":"企划策划人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0190","text":"虽然我也想看看别的风景，但正因为有制作人\n的理想，才诞生了这样的风景"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0270","text":"……虽然我们还很不成熟，满是课题\n但即便如此────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0280","text":"我仍想继续寻找那片能让她们\n用自己的色彩展翅翱翔的天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0200","text":"真的……没关系吗？\n把参赛用的画拿出来在企划展上展出……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0210","text":"没关系的。画着画着，\n就和比赛的主题偏离了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0220","text":"能被这么多人看到\n那孩子一定也很开心吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0230","text":"…………我所看到的，这个广阔的世界"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0240","text":"是吗，阳希…………你找到了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0250","text":"制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0260","text":"我有想画的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0261","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0289","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0290","text":"我回来了，小皮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0300","text":"……\n去散步……吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0310","text":"愿五彩斑斓的羽毛\n能在这片天空上自由翱翔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0320","text":"好想快点看到啊～\n冬优子酱的动画！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0330","text":"我也想让她快点给你们看，\n不过还在制作中，完成还早着呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0340","text":"超期待的～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0350","text":"────啊！　流星！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0360","text":"诶，哪里哪里！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0370","text":"你看，那边！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0371","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0380","text":"……是那颗吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0390","text":"冬优子酱，冬优子酱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0400","text":"感觉伸手就能碰到诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0402","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0403","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_99_0410","text":"…………也许吧"}]
